       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI60206.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI60206.                                         *
      *                                                                *
      *     Eliminar movimento interno                                 *
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.

       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC  X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI60206         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5808 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7204 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD8201 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV6020.
       COPY SWCV6021.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.

       COPY ARCL0039.
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY AQCW0005.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            SWITCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *01  SW-SWITCH.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT5808                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5808'.
           05 CON-SWVT7204                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT7204'.
           05 CON-SWVT8201                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT8201'.

           05 CON-PD                       PIC  X(02) VALUE 'PD'.
           05 CON-DATA-MIN                 PIC  9(08) VALUE 00010101.
           05 CON-P                        PIC  X(01) VALUE 'P'.
           05 CON-DOIS-PONTOS              PIC  X(01) VALUE ':'.
           05 CON-O00                      PIC  X(03) VALUE 'O00'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            VARIAVEIS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-MONTANTE                  PIC ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ9,99.
           05 WS-IDRECONC                  PIC S9(13) COMP-3.
           05 WS-MRNOPR                    PIC S9(09) COMP-3.
           05 WS-MRNORD                    PIC S9(07) COMP-3.

      * Cardinalidade p:q
           05 WS-COUNT-SWT58               PIC S9(09) COMP.
           05 WS-COUNT-SWT72               PIC S9(09) COMP.
           05 WS-P                         PIC  X(01).
           05 WS-Q                         PIC  X(01).
           05 WS-CNATREC-SWT58             PIC  X(03).
           05 WS-CNATREC-SWT72             PIC  X(03).

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI60206'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *              DECLARACOES DE CURSORES DB2                     *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI60206         '.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------

       COPY VIAL0004.

            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV6020-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV6020-ASE               TO SWCV6021-ASE.

       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6020-ADE               TO SWCV6021-ADE.

           PERFORM 2100-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2100-VALIDACOES-EXIT.

      * Remove movimento da reconciliacao
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2200-MODIFICA-DADOS
                 THRU 2299-MODIFICA-DADOS-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Calcular cardinalidade
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2300-CALCULA-CNATREC
                 THRU 2300-CALCULA-CNATREC-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Actualizar cardinalidade dos mov externos
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2400-ACTUALIZA-SWT58
                 THRU 2400-ACTUALIZA-SWT58-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Actualizar cardinalidade dos mov internos
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2500-ACTUALIZA-SWT72
                 THRU 2500-ACTUALIZA-SWT72-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-VALIDACOES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-VALIDACOES.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-VALIDACOES' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2100-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2200-MODIFICA-DADOS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2200-MODIFICA-DADOS.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2200-MODIFICA-DADOS'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Chave a anular
           MOVE SWCV6020-IDRECON           TO WS-IDRECONC.
           MOVE SWCV6020-MRNOPR            TO WS-MRNOPR.
           MOVE SWCV6020-MRNORD            TO WS-MRNORD.

      * Mov Internos
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2210-MODIFICA-SWT72
                 THRU 2210-MODIFICA-SWT72-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Reconciliacoes
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2220-APAGA-SWT82
                 THRU 2220-APAGA-SWT82-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2299-MODIFICA-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2210-MODIFICA-SWT72
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2210-MODIFICA-SWT72.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2210-MODIFICA-SWT72 '  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCD7204-IDRECONC.
           MOVE CON-PD                     TO SWCD7204-CCODEST.
           MOVE CON-O00                    TO SWCD7204-CNIVREC.
           MOVE CON-P                      TO SWCD7204-CTIPREC.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-CNATREC.

           MOVE VIAL0001-CUTILIZA-I        TO SWCD7204-CUSERID.

           PERFORM 2211-UPD-SWT72
              THRU 2211-UPD-SWT72-EXIT.

       2210-MODIFICA-SWT72-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2211-UPD-SWT72
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2211-UPD-SWT72.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2211-UPD-SWT72'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT7204
                 SET IDRECONC =  :SWCD7204-IDRECONC
                   , CCODEST  =  :SWCD7204-CCODEST
                   , CNIVREC  =  :SWCD7204-CNIVREC
                   , CTIPREC  =  :SWCD7204-CTIPREC
                   , CNATREC  =  :SWCD7204-CNATREC
                   , CUSERID  =  :SWCD7204-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST  =  CURRENT TIMESTAMP
               WHERE IDRECONC =  :WS-IDRECONC
                 AND MRNOPR   =  :WS-MRNOPR
                 AND MRNORD   =  :WS-MRNORD
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
           IF NOT DB2-OK AND NOT DB2-NOTFND
              SET VIAL0002-ABEND-DB2       TO TRUE
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-REMOVER    TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-CAPLIC
           END-IF.

       2211-UPD-SWT72-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2220-APAGA-SWT82
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2220-APAGA-SWT82.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2220-APAGA-SWT82'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 2221-DEL-SWT82
              THRU 2221-DEL-SWT82-EXIT.

       2220-APAGA-SWT82-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2221-DEL-SWT82
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2221-DEL-SWT82.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2221-DEL-SWT82'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              DELETE SWVT8201
               WHERE IDRECONC = :WS-IDRECONC
                 AND MRNOPR   = :WS-MRNOPR
                 AND MRNORD   = :WS-MRNORD
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT8201               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF NOT DB2-OK AND NOT DB2-NOTFND
              SET VIAL0002-ABEND-DB2       TO TRUE
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-REMOVER    TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-CAPLIC
           END-IF.

       2221-DEL-SWT82-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2300-CALCULA-CNATREC
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2300-CALCULA-CNATREC.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2300-CALCULA-CNATREC'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Contar movs extracto na reconciliacao
           PERFORM 2310-CONTAR-EXT
              THRU 2310-CONTAR-EXT-EXIT.

      * Contar mov internos na reconciliacao
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2320-CONTAR-INT
                 THRU 2320-CONTAR-INT-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Determinar cardinalidade (CNATREC)
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2330-CALC-CNATREC
                 THRU 2330-CALC-CNATREC-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2300-CALCULA-CNATREC-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2310-CONTAR-EXT
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2310-CONTAR-EXT.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2310-CONTAR-EXT'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT COUNT(COSN)
                INTO :WS-COUNT-SWT58
                FROM SWVT8201
               WHERE IDRECONC = :WS-IDRECONC
                 AND COSN     <> " "
                 AND COSNC    <> " "
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT8201               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF NOT DB2-OK
                 MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2   TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                 MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2    TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       2310-CONTAR-EXT-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2320-CONTAR-INT
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2320-CONTAR-INT.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2320-CONTAR-INT'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT COUNT(MRNOPR)
                INTO :WS-COUNT-SWT72
                FROM SWVT8201
               WHERE IDRECONC = :WS-IDRECONC
                 AND MRNOPR   <> 0
                 AND MRNORD   <> 0
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT8201               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF NOT DB2-OK
                 MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2   TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                 MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2    TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       2320-CONTAR-INT-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2330-CALC-CNATREC
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2330-CALC-CNATREC.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2330-CALC-CNATREC'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EVALUATE WS-COUNT-SWT58
            WHEN 0
              MOVE '0'                     TO WS-P
            WHEN 1
              MOVE '1'                     TO WS-P
            WHEN OTHER
              MOVE 'n'                     TO WS-P
           END-EVALUATE.

           EVALUATE WS-COUNT-SWT72
            WHEN 0
              MOVE '0'                     TO WS-Q
            WHEN 1
              MOVE '1'                     TO WS-Q
            WHEN OTHER
              MOVE 'n'                     TO WS-Q
           END-EVALUATE.

           MOVE WS-P                       TO WS-CNATREC-SWT58(1:1).
           MOVE CON-DOIS-PONTOS            TO WS-CNATREC-SWT58(2:1).
           MOVE WS-Q                       TO WS-CNATREC-SWT58(3:1).

           MOVE WS-Q                       TO WS-CNATREC-SWT72(1:1).
           MOVE CON-DOIS-PONTOS            TO WS-CNATREC-SWT72(2:1).
           MOVE WS-P                       TO WS-CNATREC-SWT72(3:1).

       2330-CALC-CNATREC-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2400-ACTUALIZA-SWT58
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2400-ACTUALIZA-SWT58.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2400-ACTUALIZA-SWT58'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6021-IDRECON           TO SWCD5808-IDRECONC.
           MOVE WS-CNATREC-SWT58           TO SWCD5808-CNATREC.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT5808
                 SET CNATREC  = :SWCD5808-CNATREC
               WHERE IDRECONC = :SWCD5808-IDRECONC
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT5808               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF NOT DB2-OK AND NOT DB2-NOTFND
              SET VIAL0002-ABEND-DB2       TO TRUE
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-CRIACAO    TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-CAPLIC
           END-IF.

       2400-ACTUALIZA-SWT58-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2500-ACTUALIZA-SWT72
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2500-ACTUALIZA-SWT72.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2500-ACTUALIZA-SWT72 ' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6021-IDRECON           TO SWCD7204-IDRECONC.
           MOVE WS-CNATREC-SWT72           TO SWCD7204-CNATREC.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT7204
                 SET CNATREC  = :SWCD7204-CNATREC
               WHERE IDRECONC = :SWCD7204-IDRECONC
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF NOT DB2-OK AND NOT DB2-NOTFND
              SET VIAL0002-ABEND-DB2       TO TRUE
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-CRIACAO    TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-CAPLIC
           END-IF.

       2500-ACTUALIZA-SWT72-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6021-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV6021-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV6021-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY VIAP0015.
           COPY ARCR0039.
           COPY AQCP0005.
